    "body": "I'd be very happy to join this if I don't have other group conflicts, which\nI dont seem to at the moment at least.\n\nOn Thu, Jun 30, 2022 at 4:59 AM Simon Pieters ***@***.***>\nwrote:\n\n> See\n>\n>    - https://matrixlogs.bakkot.com/WHATWG/2022-06-29#L13-L14\n>    - https://matrixlogs.bakkot.com/WHATWG/2022-06-30#L0-L4\n>\n> We can propose a 50-minute breakout session at TPAC\n> <https://www.w3.org/wiki/TPAC/2022> on Wednesday, possibly giving a group\n> update for what has happened in HTML in the past year or so, and some time\n> for discussion. The group update can also be a pre-recorded video\n> <https://www.w3.org/wiki/TPAC/2022/Demos_and_Group_updates>.\n>\n> Is there interest for a breakout session? I can help prepare and present,\n> but would welcome collaboration on that.\n>\n> We can also try to get a 4-hour meeting scheduled. Is there interest for a\n> meeting? If so, please suggest agenda items below.\n>\n> —\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\n> <https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8056>, or unsubscribe\n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/AAGUQZO5NQAJKB7DDV2AUH3VRVOVNANCNFSM52ISAG4A>\n> .\n> You are receiving this because you are subscribed to this thread.Message\n> ID: ***@***.***>\n>\n\n\n-- \nBrian Kardell :: @briankardell :: bkardell.com\n",
